{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"348b3758-fe3d-4ec9-a21e-ce2200f222bc","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have investigated why the nightly launchd job never reported anything and applied the fixes across the snapshot files. The findings and explanations have been documented in [ANSWER.md](file:///private/tmp/h-I6jaZG/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Causes \u0026 Fixes\n\n1. **`claude` failed on missing `USER` environment variable:**\n   - **Cause:** LaunchAgents run in a minimal environment missing `USER`. Without `USER`, `claude` cannot find the login session in the macOS keychain and terminated with `Not logged in · Please run /login`.\n   - **Fix:** Added `USER` (`vk`) to `EnvironmentVariables` in [com.vk.nightly-review.plist](file:///private/tmp/h-I6jaZG/Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist#L24-L28).\n\n2. **Messenger died before reporting failure due to `status` assignment in zsh:**\n   - **Cause:** In [nightly-review.zsh](file:///private/tmp/h-I6jaZG/bin/nightly-review.zsh#L18-L20), `status=$?` was executed immediately after `claude`. In `zsh`, `status` is a read-only built-in variable (synonymous with `$?`). Attempting to assign to it crashed the script immediately (`read-only variable: status`) before reaching the `\"$NOTIFY\"` call.\n   - **Fix:** Changed variable assignment from `status=$?` to `rc=$?` (and `$rc`) in [nightly-review.zsh](file:///private/tmp/h-I6jaZG/bin/nightly-review.zsh#L19-L23), and added `\u003c /dev/null` to the `claude` command.\n\n3. **Keychain lookup in `notify.sh` when keychain is locked at night:**\n   - **Cause:** At 02:30, the keychain is locked and `security find-generic-password` fails. Although `.config/nightly-review/config.toml` was created for this reason, `notify.sh` never checked it.\n   - **Fix:** Updated [notify.sh](file:///private/tmp/h-I6jaZG/bin/notify.sh#L4-L16) to read `telegram_bot_token` and `chat_id` from `.config/nightly-review/config.toml` when `TG_BOT_TOKEN` is not already set.\n","duration_seconds":134.160885,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":167755,"output_tokens":3693,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":495027,"total_tokens":171448}}}
